{{- /* Decrypts a SOPS+age-encrypted secret and returns its plaintext contents.

     Defaults to opaque binary handling (no structured key/value parsing),
     which works for any file type — PEM, JSON, or otherwise. Pass
     type "json" (or "yaml"/"dotenv"/"ini") for a structured file encrypted
     with SOPS's native partial-value mode, so only leaf values were
     ciphertext at rest while keys/structure stayed diffable in git.
     Requires the `sops` binary and a readable age private key
     (SOPS_AGE_KEY_FILE, SOPS_AGE_KEY_CMD, or sops's default key file location).

     See openspec/specs/sops-age-encryption/ for the full design (key
     custody, .sops.yaml scoping, encrypted-file naming convention).

     Ordering constraint: chezmoi renders every .tmpl target during Read(),
     before it runs any script — so a run_onchange_ script's numeric position
     (e.g. the age-key installer at darwin-43) does NOT guarantee it has run
     before a template calling this partial is rendered in the same apply.
     A consumer whose plaintext depends on an age key that a script installs
     must not let a missing key hard-fail this partial (aborting Read() for
     the entire apply); instead, guard the consuming target with a
     .chezmoiignore.tmpl conditional keyed on the key file's presence
     (`{{ if not (stat $ageKeyPath) }}`), following the Cloudflare Tunnel
     cert.pem/credentials-JSON guard in home/.chezmoiignore.tmpl. See
     openspec/changes/harden-chezmoi-bootstrap-and-permissions/design.md
     Decision 2.

     Parameters (pass as dict merged with root context):
     - file (required): Path to the SOPS-encrypted source file, relative to
       .chezmoi.sourceDir (e.g. "private_dot_cloudflared/cert.pem.sops").
     - type (optional): SOPS --input-type/--output-type value. Defaults to
       "binary".

     Usage:
       {{ includeTemplate "sopsDecrypt" (merge (dict "file" "private_dot_cloudflared/cert.pem.sops") .) }}
       {{ includeTemplate "sopsDecrypt" (merge (dict "file" "private_dot_cloudflared/foo.json.sops" "type" "json") .) }}

     Returns:
     - The decrypted plaintext contents of the file.
*/ -}}
{{- $type := index . "type" | default "binary" -}}
{{- output "sops" "--decrypt" "--input-type" $type "--output-type" $type (printf "%s/%s" .chezmoi.sourceDir .file) -}}
